        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trick-Trick, Proof, Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Kon Artis, Eminem, Diezel\n- Groups: D12, Goon Sqwad\n- Products: The People vs., The Villain, \"Welcome 2 Detroit\"\n- Places: Detroit, Michigan\n\nFacts:\n- DeShaun Dupree Holton, known as Proof, was born on October 2, 1973, and died on April 11, 2006.\n- Proof was an American rapper and actor from Detroit, Michigan.\n- \"Welcome 2 Detroit\" is the lead single from Trick-Trick's debut studio album, The People vs.\n- The People vs. featured guest appearances by Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, D12 members Proof, Kon Artis, and Eminem, and Trick-Trick's brother and Goon Sqwad bandmate Diezel.\n- The Villain is the second studio album by American rapper Trick-Trick.",
